  "details": "Using Device iPhone 13 Pro Max. iOS 18.0 (22A5326f)\n\nRepro:\n\n1. Open quick menu\n\n2. Hit “Select User”\n\n3. Hit the exit (X) button (not the select button!)\n\nDoing this will cause the quick menu to immediately open and then transition close. The expected behaviour is for the quick menu to stay closed rather than to reopen for half a second.",
